AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021003> "Colonel Klink giving Sergeant Schultz an order, Jake promising Jill to take her to the junior prom"@en)
