# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021007> (document act input document)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021007> "A document that is intended to be the specified input in a document act. It has a plan specification as a part that specifies the intended socio-legal entities that are created through the document (objective specification) and the way in which the document act is to be performed (by signing, by stamping, etc.) (action specification)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021007> "Mathias Brochhausen"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021007> "document act input document"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021007> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000310>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021008> (deontic role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021008> "Jane Doe's power role that is realized by her creating the duty holder role for a trauma medical director to report to the Board of Trustees, John Doe's claimant role that is realized by him taking posession of the the house he just bought."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021008> "A role that inheres in an agent and which is externally grounded exclusively in the normative expectations that other agents within a social context have concerning how that agent should behave or is allowed to behave."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021008> "Deontic roles are purely the roles based on deontic expectations (hence the word \"exclusively\" in the definition). They are not meant to represent all social roles that come with deontic expectations, e.g., police officer or trauma surgeon."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021008> "Mathias Brochhausen"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021008> "Neil Otte"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021008> "deontic role"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0021008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>)

